        "stage": 15,
        "statement": "Flooding affecting many lowlying areas adjacent to the river specifically homes in the Target Range and Orchard Homes neighborhoods is possible."
      },
      {
        "stage": 14,
        "statement": "Flooding affecting low lying areas near Mcclay Bridge and homes in the Target Range area is possible."
      },
      {
        "stage": 12,
        "statement": "Flooding of farmland and some roads along the Bitterroot River from Lolo to the confluence with the Clark Fork River is possible."
      },
      {
        "stage": 11,
        "statement": "Flooding to low lying areas adjacent to the river is possible."
